  - Data masking for sensitive fields
  - Audit trails for all create/update/delete operations
- Validation:
  - Use Array.isArray() guards and data ?? [] patterns
  - Validate date formats, numeric ranges, required fields
  - Validate relationships (accountId exists, categoryId if provided)
- Testing:
  - Unit tests for UI components with null-safe data
  - Integration tests for API endpoints validating shape with data ?? [] defaults
  - End-to-end tests for the user journey: filter, bulk actions, reconciliation, export

