## UI/UX Guidelines

Apply LifeOps design system and the provided Visual Style details:

- Color Palette
  - Primary background: #18191C
  - Card backgrounds: #232429 or #1F2124
  - Text: #FFFFFF for headings; #AEB2B8 for secondary; #74777D for placeholders
  - Accent: #4F8CFF (blue), #5ED36D (green), #FFD66C (yellow), #EF6464 (red)
  - Dividers: #26282C with 30–60% opacity

- Typography
  - Font family: Inter or similar
  - Weights: 700 (bold), 600 (semibold), 400 (regular)
  - Hierarchy: Large headers, spaced sections, card titles bold

- Layout
  - 12-column grid with 24–32px gutters
  - Cards with 12–16px border radius, subtle shadows
  - Left navigation and top bar as per project patterns

- Interactive Elements
  - Buttons: Primary blue (#4F8CFF); rounded rectangles
  - Form fields: Large, rounded with clear placeholders
  - Hover/focus states: accent color outlines, gentle glow

- Data Visualization
  - Lightweight charts on dark background; clear color-coding for status

- Accessibility
  - Keyboard navigable, screen-reader friendly controls, high-contrast focus outlines

